# Root build context (backend + worker build from `context: .`). Keep the
# context small so image builds don't ship junk. CI checks out clean, but this
# also speeds up local docker builds.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
.git
.github
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*
warehouse
etl-data
**/coverage
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
*.md
docs
design-mockups
